		sections={
			{id=9560,title="Overview",body="Upon reaching 70% and 30% health, Blackhand causes the floor beneath the players to give out, falling to a lower level of the tower and changing the environmental hazards that he brings to bear to destroy his foes."},
			{id=9561,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;During the initial phase, stay far from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:156479|h[Massive Demolition]|h|r's impact point, and take shelter behind Debris Piles if you are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:156096|h[Marked for Death]|h|r.\n$bullet;Once falling to the second level, defeat Siegemakers and Iron Soldiers.\n$bullet;On the third level, avoid being knocked off by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:175013|h[Impaling Throw]|h|r."},
			{id=9562,title="Healers",body="$bullet;During the initial phase, stay far from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:156479|h[Massive Demolition]|h|r's impact point, and take shelter behind Debris Piles if you are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:156096|h[Marked for Death]|h|r.\n$bullet;Once falling to the second level, Iron Soldiers will fire at players, inflicting raid damage.\n$bullet;On the third level players hit with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:175013|h[Impaling Throw]|h|r and Slag Bombs require significant healing."},
			{id=9563,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;During the initial phase, Blackhand will knock his primary target into the Molten Slag.\n$bullet;On the second level, Iron Soldiers spawn on the balcony above and must be killed.\n$bullet;On the third level, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:158054|h[Massive Shattering Smash]|h|r causes large Slag Craters that must be avoided."},
			{id=8814,title="Stage One: The Blackrock Forge",body="Blackhand pours Molten Slag into the moulding of the room, the slag slowly encroaches on players as the phase progresses."},
			{id=9564,title="Molten Slag"},
			{id=9565,title="Demolition"},
			{id=10685,title="Section 30"},
			{id=9566,title="Debris Pile",body="Debris Piles are created from the Massive Demolition. Debris Piles will be destroyed by Molten Slag or when an Impaling Throw impacts with it."},
			{id=9567,title="Marked for Death"},
			{id=10742,title="Impaling Throw"},
			{id=9568,title="Throw Slag Bombs"},
			{id=9569,title="Slagged"},
			{id=9570,title="Shattering Smash"},
			{id=8816,title="Stage Two: Storage Warehouse",body="Blackhand has stored deadly siege weaponry and calls in reinforcements on the balcony above."},
			{id=9571,title="Siegemaker",body="Siegemakers are called in periodically by Blackhand and Fixate on the nearest target and go into an Overdrive after casting Mortar."},
			{id=9572,title="Mortar"},
			{id=9573,title="Overdrive"},
			{id=9574,title="Black Iron Plating"},
			{id=9575,title="Battering Ram"},
			{id=9576,title="Iron Soldier",body="Iron Soldiers reinforce the balcony at an increasing rate."},
