		sections={
			{id=9461,title="Overview",body="Bonemaw smashes his massive frame across the platform to crush his foes, as lesser carrion worms rise from the depths. Periodically, Bonemaw attempts to inhale all players with powerful suction."},
			{id=10732,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153395|h[Body Slam]|h|r from Bonemaw and the lesser Carrion Worms.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:153692|h[Necrotic Pitch]|h|r is damaging, but standing in it as Bonemaw begins to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153804|h[Inhale]|h|r will negate his suction."},
