			{id=9657,title="Slag Elemental",body="Slag Elementals will go Dormant and remove the Damage Shield of any nearby Primal Elementalist when they are reduced to 1 hitpoint.  While Dormant, the Fury's Blasts will restore $155239s1 Energy. When the Slag Elemental reaches 100 Energy they will revive.",difficultyIDs={14,15,16}},
