			{itemID=113906,diffs={14,15,16},faction=-1},
			{itemID=113907,diffs={14,15,16},faction=-1},
			{itemID=113908,diffs={14,15,16},faction=-1},
			{itemID=113910,diffs={14,15,16},faction=-1},
			{itemID=116311,diffs={17},faction=-1},
			{itemID=116217,diffs={17},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=9843,title="Overview",body="The battle against Hans'gar and Franzok takes place amidst an operational Blackrock assembly line.\n\nAt fixed health thresholds, one of the twin orcs jumps out of the fight space to activate the factory machinery, enabling the conveyor belts that bear plates of molten Blackrock ore, or massive presses that stamp down from overhead."},
			{id=9845,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Franzok's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:160838|h[Disrupting Roar]|h|r interrupts spellcasting, and is performed more quickly as he gains Rage.\n$bullet;Hans'gar and Franzok are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:161029|h[Bound by Blood]|h|r and share a single effective health pool."},
			{id=9846,title="Healers",body="$bullet;When either Hans'gar or Franzok land they cause |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157853|h[Aftershocks]|h|r that deal raid-wide damage.\n$bullet;Franzok's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:160838|h[Disrupting Roar]|h|r interrupts casting, and is performed more quickly as he gains Rage.\n$bullet;When either Hans'gar or Franzok leaves the fight space, they will pick up both tanks and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:156938|h[Crippling Suplex]|h|r them together for high Physical damage."},
			{id=9844,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;When either Hans'gar or Franzok leaves the fight space, they will pick up both tanks and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:156938|h[Crippling Suplex]|h|r them together for high Physical damage.\n$bullet;When Hans'gar and Franzok land from jumping they will inflict |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157139|h[Shattered Vertebrae]|h|r, which increases damage taken with each application in an area around them."},
			{id=10089,title="Environmental Threats",body="The battle takes place admist an active Blackrock processing line, which poses many dangers to the unaware player."},
			{id=9851,title="Searing Plates"},
			{id=9852,title="Scorching Burns"},
			{id=9853,title="Stamping Presses"},
			{id=9864,title="Smart Stampers",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=9857,title="Franzok"},
			{id=9862,title="Shattered Vertebrae",body="$[!16 In Mythic difficulty, this effect inflicts $157139s2 Physical damage split evenly among enemies within $157139A2 yards. $]"},
			{id=9863,title="Aftershock"},
			{id=9850,title="Bound by Blood"},
			{id=9848,title="Crippling Suplex"},
			{id=9858,title="Disrupting Roar"},
			{id=9849,title="Pumped Up",body="When Hans'gar or Franzok take damage, they gain increasing amounts of Rage.\n\nAs their Rage increases, Pumped Up increases in power and they inflict more melee damage, increase the hammers thrown by Skullcracker, reduce the cast time of Disrupting Roar, and increase the number of jumps performed during Body Slam."},
			{id=9859,title="Skullcracker"},
			{id=9860,title="Hans'gar"},
			{id=9855,title="Shattered Vertebrae",body="$[!16 In Mythic difficulty, this effect inflicts $157139s2 Physical damage split evenly among enemies within $157139A2 yards. $]"},
			{id=9856,title="Aftershock"},
			{id=10674,title="Section 25"},
			{id=10675,title="Section 23"},
			{id=10676,title="Pumped Up",body="When Hans'gar or Franzok take damage, they gain increasing amounts of Rage.\n\nAs their Rage increases, Pumped Up increases in power and they inflict more melee damage, increase the hammers thrown by Skullcracker, reduce the cast time of Disrupting Roar, and increase the number of jumps performed by Jump Slam."},
		},
	},
