		sections={
			{id=9692,title="Overview",body="The massive magnaron Kromog stands immobile overlooking a ledge as he assaults players with his fists and the very stone beneath them. Many of Kromog's mighty attacks create |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157247|h[Reverberations]|h|r, and at 30% remaining health, Kromog gains the effect of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:156861|h[Frenzy]|h|r."},
			{id=9693,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Allow yourself to be gripped by a hand created by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157060|h[Rune of Grasping Earth]|h|r in order to avoid critical damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157054|h[Thundering Blows]|h|r.\n$bullet;Kromog's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:156704|h[Slam]|h|r ability deals less damage the farther away players are from his fists when they slam onto the ground.\n$bullet;Kromog's normal attacks cause |cFF2959D3|Hspell:162349|h[Fists of Stone]|h|r, inflicting heavy damage which may be shared by up to 2 targets.\n$bullet;If Kromog is not being tanked, he will continually cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:156844|h[Stone Breath]|h|r."},
			{id=9694,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Allow yourself to be gripped by a hand created by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157060|h[Rune of Grasping Earth]|h|r in order to avoid critical damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157054|h[Thundering Blows]|h|r.\n$bullet;Players gripped by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157060|h[Rune of Grasping Earth]|h|r eventually become crushed to death, due to increasing damage over time."},
			{id=9695,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Allow yourself to be gripped by a hand created by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157060|h[Rune of Grasping Earth]|h|r in order to avoid critical damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157054|h[Thundering Blows]|h|r.\n$bullet;Free yourself from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157060|h[Rune of Grasping Earth]|h|r once |cFF2959D3|Hspell:157054|h[Thundering Blows]|h|r is complete, then help free other players who are still grasped."},
			{id=9696,title="Warped Armor"},
			{id=9697,title="Fists of Stone"},
			{id=10249,title="Stone Breath"},
			{id=9698,title="Slam"},
			{id=9699,title="Rippling Smash"},
			{id=9700,title="Rune of the Grasping Hand"},
