		sections={
			{id=9823,title="Overview",body="The Vigilant carves patterns of searing light into the ground and hurls his massive shield-arms to assault his foes."},
			{id=10717,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Take shelter behind Kaathar's hurled |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153480|h[Holy Shield]|h|r to protect yourself from his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153006|h[Consecrated Light]|h|r."},
			{id=10716,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Take shelter behind Kaathar's hurled |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153480|h[Holy Shield]|h|r to protect yourself from his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153006|h[Consecrated Light]|h|r."},
			{id=10718,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Take shelter behind Kaathar's hurled |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153480|h[Holy Shield]|h|r to protect yourself from his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153006|h[Consecrated Light]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid positioning Kaathar too close to his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153480|h[Holy Shield]|h|r to ensure that there is a safe location to hide from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:153006|h[Consecrated Light]|h|r."},
