		sections={
			{id=10472,title="Overview",body="Archmage Sol struggles against the parasite's control, cycling between Fire, Frost, and Arcane schools of magic. Each time her school affinity changes, she immediately uses a powerful spell from that school."},
			{id=10474,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;In addition to inflicting damage, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428082|h[Glacial Fusion]|h|r stuns players on contact.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:428139|h[Spatial Compression]|h|r pulls all players towards its impact location, no matter where they are."},
			{id=10475,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:427899|h[Cinderbolt Storm]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to all players.\n$bullet;In addition to inflicting damage, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428082|h[Glacial Fusion]|h|r stuns players on contact.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:428139|h[Spatial Compression]|h|r pulls all players towards its impact location, no matter where they are."},
			{id=10473,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;In addition to inflicting damage, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:428082|h[Glacial Fusion]|h|r stuns players on contact.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:428139|h[Spatial Compression]|h|r pulls all players towards its impact location, no matter where they are."},
