			{id=10286,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Destroy Ragewing Whelps as quickly as possible.\n$bullet;Standing towards the middle of the bridge will make it easier to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:155031|h[Engulfing Fire]|h|r.\n$bullet;Spreading out will decrease the chance of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:155053|h[Magma Spit]|h|r affecting more than one person."},
