			{id=10308,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;When running away from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:155728|h[Black Iron Cyclone]|h|r, avoid leading Zaela into your alies.\n$bullet;Spread out from others to avoid chaining |cFF2959D3|Hspell:155705|h[Rebounding Blade]|h|r to other targets."},
