		sections={
			{id=11006,title="Overview",body="Gorefiend devours the spirits of players who otherwise would have suffered fatal damage. When consumed, players enter Gorefiend's stomach, which is full of hostile Trapped Souls that attempt to escape into the outside world to attack the raid. While inside Gorefiend's stomach, players can damage these Souls to weaken or defeat them before they escape.\n\nEach Soul that is released or slain reduces Gorefiend's energy. When Gorefiend reaches zero energy he begins a Feast of Souls, which recharges him to begin his assault anew."},
			{id=11007,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:179864|h[Shadow of Death]|h|r targets random players. When slain, use the opportunity to damage Trapped Souls within Gorefiend's stomach.\n$bullet;If afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:179978|h[Touch of Doom]|h|r, move as far away from other players as possible.\n$bullet;Move quickly towards the immobilized target if afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:179909|h[Shared Fate]|h|r\n$bullet;Run into an |cFF2959D3|Hspell:184437|h[Unstable Soul]|h|r when Gorefiend performs |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181973|h[Feast of Souls]|h|r."},
			{id=11008,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:179864|h[Shadow of Death]|h|r targets random players. When slain, fully heal Tortured Essences to free them from Gorefiend's power.\n$bullet;If afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:179978|h[Touch of Doom]|h|r, move as far away from other players as possible.\n$bullet;Move quickly towards the immobilized target if afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:179909|h[Shared Fate]|h|r"},
			{id=11009,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:179864|h[Shadow of Death]|h|r targets random players. When slain, tank the Enraged Spirit within Gorefiend's stomach.\n$bullet;Avoid the Enraged Spirit's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181282|h[Fel Fury]|h|r.\n$bullet;At 70% life, the Enraged Spirit escapes from the stomach and becomes a powerful Gorebound Spirit that must be tanked.\n$bullet;When Gorefiend reaches 0 energy he begins a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181973|h[Feast of Souls]|h|r."},
			{id=11010,title="Gorefiend"},
			{id=11544,title="Devourer of Souls",body="Players who are killed are not slain outright. Instead, Gorefiend devours their souls, placing them in his stomach where they will be Digested. Players who have recently been consumed are afflicted with Gorefiend's Corruption and if they die again their soul is lost."},
			{id=11547,title="Corrupted Soul",body="When a player is slain a fragment of their soul is left behind and deeply corrupted by Gorefiend. The result is a being of pure malice, bent on consuming the living.  Only when this fragment is destroyed will the player who was consumed be freed from Gorefiend's stomach.",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=11548,title="Section 32",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=11546,title="Section 30"},
			{id=11545,title="Section 29",body="$[!16\nIn Mythic difficulty Gorefiend's Corruption is only removed when a player collapses an Unstable Soul.$]"},
			{id=11961,title="Section 39"},
			{id=11012,title="Section 11"},
			{id=11013,title="Section 7",difficultyIDs={14,15,16}},
			{id=11016,title="Section 10",difficultyIDs={14,15,16}},
			{id=11848,title="Section 38",difficultyIDs={17}},
