			{itemID=127962,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=127963,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=11193,title="Overview",body="Players initially face a set of Fel Iron Summoners that call servants of the Legion into Draenor. After their defeat, Gul'dan resurrects Mannoroth. When Mannoroth reaches 65% and 30% health, Gul'dan overcharges the Fel Spires to further empower the pit lord.\n$[!16\n\nIn Mythic difficulty, Gul'dan reclaims the Fel power from the Fel Iron Summoners to resurrect Mannoroth, keeping the Doom Lord's Fel Spire intact.$]"},
			{id=11194,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Avoid triggering |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181099|h[Mark of Doom]|h|r while standing near your allies.\n$bullet;Once Mannoroth is resurrected, group up for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181597|h[Mannoroth's Gaze]|h|r.\n$bullet;When Mannoroth is at full strength, avoid being pushed off by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181799|h[Shadowforce]|h|r.\n$bullet;After Gul'dan fully empowers Mannoroth, avoid damage from the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181948|h[Empowered Fel Hellstorm]|h|r."},
			{id=11195,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Avoid triggering |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181099|h[Mark of Doom]|h|r while standing near your allies.\n$bullet;Once Mannoroth is resurrected, group up for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181597|h[Mannoroth's Gaze]|h|r and prepare to dispel it when appropriate.\n$bullet;When Mannoroth is at full strength, heal allies being pushed off by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181799|h[Shadowforce]|h|r.\n$bullet;After Gul'dan fully empowers Mannoroth, avoid damage from the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181948|h[Empowered Fel Hellstorm]|h|r."},
			{id=11196,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;During the initial phase, only Doom Lords need to be tanked.\n$bullet;Once Mannoroth is resurrected be prepared for|cFF2959D3|Hspell:181354|h[Glaive Combo]|h|r.\n$bullet;When Mannoroth is at full strength, avoid the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181557|h[Fel Hellstorm]|h|r.\n$bullet;After Gul'dan fully empowers Mannoroth, avoid damage from the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181948|h[Empowered Fel Hellstorm]|h|r."},
			{id=11197,title="Stage One: The Legion's Might",body="Fel Iron Summoners leverage the power of the Fel Spires and unleash the Legion into this world.\n$[!16\n\nIn Mythic difficulty, Gul'dan reclaims the Fel power from the Fel Iron Summoners to resurrect Mannoroth, keeping the Doom Lord's Fel Spire intact.$]"},
			{id=11226,title="Section 34",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=11198,title="Doom Lord",body="Doom Lords are created when the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181275|h[Curse of the Legion]|h|r expires or is dispelled."},
			{id=11227,title="Section 35"},
			{id=11809,title="Explosive Doom Spike",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=11228,title="Section 36"},
			{id=11229,title="Shadow Bolt Volley"},
			{id=11202,title="Marked for Death",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=11230,title="Fel Imp",body="Fel Imps are created at the location of the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:181255|h[Fel Imp-losion]|h|r's impact."},
			{id=11203,title="Impaling Throw"},
			{id=11231,title="Section 40"},
			{id=11810,title="Phase Explosion",difficultyIDs={16}},
