			{itemID=128113,diffs={17},faction=-1},
			{itemID=138808,diffs={14,15,16,17},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=11254,title="Overview",body="Kilrogg's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:182428|h[Visions of Death]|h|r transports players to the moment of their doom. The more demons a player kills during this phase, the greater stacks of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:180718|h[Undying Resolve]|h|r they receive. Failure to send anyone to this phase results in heavy raid damage. \n\nAs the fight progresses, Kilrogg calls for his clansmen to drink the fel blood within the chamber. If these Salivating Bloodthirsters reach the blood, they transform into Hulking Terrors."},
			{id=11255,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Blood Globules that reach Kilrogg Deadeye damage the raid.\n$bullet;Fel Blood Globules that reach Kilrogg damage the raid and heal Kilrogg.\n$bullet;Enter |cFF2959D3|Hspell:182428|h[Visions of Death]|h|r and kill demons to gain stacks of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:180718|h[Undying Resolve]|h|r.\n$bullet;Kill Salivating Bloodthirsters before they reach the blood pool.\n$bullet;Interrupt the Hulking Terror's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:183917|h[Rending Howl]|h|r."},
			{id=11256,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Heal players affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:180372|h[Heart Seeker]|h|r to keep them alive.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:180224|h[Death Throes]|h|r pulses damage to the raid.\n$bullet;Enter |cFF2959D3|Hspell:182428|h[Visions of Death]|h|r and heal allies. Each demon killed grants stacks of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:185563|h[Undying Salvation]|h|r."},
			{id=11257,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Prevent Hulking Terrors from dying next to allies.\n$bullet;Take turns tanking Hulking Terrors to control your level of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:182159|h[Fel Corruption]|h|r and avoid losing control to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:180313|h[Demonic Possession]|h|r.\n$bullet;Use Active Mitigation defensive abilities to counter |cFF2959D3|Hspell:180199|h[Shred]|h|r or else suffer from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:180200|h[Shredded Armor]|h|r."},
			{id=11258,title="Kilrogg Deadeye"},
			{id=11280,title="Fel Corruption",body="Throughout the fight, Fel Corruption is inflicted onto the raid. As Fel Corruption increases on a target, it inflicts increasing damage over time.\n\nAt 100 Fel Corruption, the target is dominated by the Burning Legion."},
			{id=11272,title="Section 20"},
			{id=11259,title="Shred"},
			{id=11260,title="Section 7",body="$[!16\nIn Mythic difficulty, as the fight progresses Kilrogg picks multiple targets for Heart Seeker. Also, the Heart Seeker debuff will last the duration of the encounter.$]"},
			{id=11804,title="Blood Splatter"},
			{id=11261,title="Blood Globule",body="Summoned next to a player affected by Heart Seeker. Immediately begins making its way towards Kilrogg."},
			{id=11262,title="Section 12"},
			{id=11263,title="Fel Blood Globule",body="Summoned next to a player affected by Heart Seeker who is covered in Fel Blood. Immediately begins making its way towards Kilrogg."},
			{id=11267,title="Section 14"},
			{id=11264,title="Section 8",body="$[!16\nIn Mythic difficulty, Death Throes inflicts Fel Corruption onto the raid.$]"},
			{id=11841,title="Section 33"},
			{id=11265,title="Section 9"},
			{id=11268,title="Section 26"},
			{id=11654,title="Undying Salvation"},
			{id=11721,title="Section 30"},
			{id=11266,title="Salivating Bloodthirster",body="Immediately starts running for the blood pool when summoned."},
			{id=11269,title="Hulking Terror",body="Salivating Bloodthirsters transform into these terrors if they reach the blood pool."},
			{id=11270,title="Section 16"},
			{id=11271,title="Section 17"},
			{id=11479,title="Section 29"},
			{id=11273,title="Section 18",body="$[!16\nIn Mythic difficulty, Fel Rupture leaves behind a Fel Puddle. Fel Puddles that have not been removed summon Fel Blood Globules during Death Throes.$]"},
			{id=11777,title="Section 31",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=11274,title="Hellblaze Imp",body="The footsoldier of the Burning Legion, encountered during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:182428|h[Visions of Death]|h|r."},
			{id=11275,title="Section 21"},
			{id=11276,title="Hellblaze Fiend",body="The brute of the Burning Legion, encountered during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:182428|h[Visions of Death]|h|r."},
			{id=11277,title="Section 23"},
			{id=11278,title="Hellblaze Mistress",body="The elite of the Burning Legion, encountered during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:182428|h[Visions of Death]|h|r."},
			{id=11279,title="Section 25"},
		},
	},
